cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository or its published results in academic work,
  please cite the repository.
title: "Finite-Key BB84 QKD Simulator"
type: software
version: 1.0.3
date-released: 2026-07-31
abstract: >-
  A reproducible educational Python simulator for the BB84 quantum key
  distribution protocol, including intercept-resend analysis, detection-loss
  models, and an illustrative finite-size key-length estimate.
authors:
  - family-names: "Lam"
    given-names: "Thanh Dat"
keywords:
  - "BB84"
  - "finite-key analysis"
  - "quantum key distribution"
  - "simulation"
